sequenceDiagram
  participant TabA as Tab A
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as Database
  participant Socket as Socket.IO Room
  participant TabB as Tab B

  TabA->>API: PATCH /user/profile
  API->>API: validate and normalize profile fields
  API->>DB: persist profile update
  DB-->>API: updated user
  API->>Socket: emit user:profile-updated
  API-->>TabA: updated user response
  Socket-->>TabB: user:profile-updated
  TabB->>TabB: map changedFields to RTK Query tags
  TabB->>API: refetch active affected queries
  API-->>TabB: fresh user/analytics/report/transaction data
